---

<section class="quien">

    <div class="section-head">
        <span class="pill">Especialidades</span>
        <h2>¿A quién <em>atiendo?</em></h2>
        <p>Acompañamiento personalizado para distintas necesidades</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">

        <article class="card">
            <img src="/img/emprendedores4.webp" alt="Emprendedores" />
            <div class="overlay">
                <span class="cat">Emprendedores</span>
                <p>Supera los desafíos, lidera con éxito y equilibra tu vida personal y profesional.</p>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
            <img src="/img/ansiedad6a.webp" alt="Ansiedad social" />
            <div class="overlay">
                <span class="cat">Ansiedad Social</span>
                <p>Supera tus miedos en la vinculación social y potencia tus interacciones.</p>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
            <img src="/img/influ22a.webp" alt="Content creator" />
            <div class="overlay">
                <span class="cat">Content Creator</span>
                <p>Maneja la presión con estrategias de psicología para la resiliencia ante las críticas.</p>
            </div>
        </article>

    </div>

</section>

<style>
    .quien {
        padding: 60px 0 50px;
    }

    /* ── HEADER ── */
    .section-head {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
    }

    .pill {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #1c584c;
        color: #8bfd2c;
        padding: 5px 16px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .section-head h2 {
        font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px);
        font-weight: 200;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .section-head h2 em {
        font-style: normal;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #1c584c;
    }

    .section-head p {
        color: #888;
        font-size: clamp(14px, 1.4vw, 16px);
        font-weight: 300;
    }

    /* ── GRID ── */
    .grid {
        width: 90%;
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 14px;
    }

    /* ── CARD ── */
    .card {
        position: relative;
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        height: 200px;
        cursor: pointer;
        animation: revealCard linear both;
        animation-timeline: view();
        animation-range: entry 0% cover 35%;
    }

    @keyframes revealCard {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
        to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .card img {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        filter: brightness(0.68);
        transition: transform 500ms ease, filter 500ms ease;
        will-change: transform;
    }

    .card:hover img {
        transform: scale(1.06);
        filter: brightness(0.55);
    }

    /* ── OVERLAY ── */
    .overlay {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 0 48px;
        background: linear-gradient(
            90deg,
            rgba(28,88,76,0.80) 0%,
            rgba(28,88,76,0.30) 55%,
            transparent 100%
        );
    }

    .cat {
        color: #8bfd2c;
        font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 24px);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .overlay p {
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.88);
        font-size: clamp(13px, 1.3vw, 15px);
        font-weight: 300;
        line-height: 1.55;
        max-width: 420px;
    }

    /* ── MOBILE ── */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .quien { padding: 44px 0 36px; }

        .grid { width: 94%; gap: 10px; }

        .card { height: 175px; }

        .overlay { padding: 0 22px; gap: 6px; }

        .overlay p { max-width: 100%; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .card { height: 155px; }
    }
</style>
